    2187.  00:4D8B                      TEXTO_CINEMATICA_1_1:
    2188.  00:4D8B                      		db		"The story of Gamourla isn't exactly as ",0
    2188.  00:4D8B  54 68 65 20 73 74 6F 72 79 20 6F 66 20 47 61 6D 
    2188.  00:4D9B  6F 75 72 6C 61 20 69 73 6E 27 74 20 65 78 61 63 
    2188.  00:4DAB  74 6C 79 20 61 73 20 00 
    2189.  00:4DB3                      TEXTO_CINEMATICA_1_2:
    2190.  00:4DB3                      		db		"you were told. Although it's a ",0
    2190.  00:4DB3  79 6F 75 20 77 65 72 65 20 74 6F 6C 64 2E 20 41 
    2190.  00:4DC3  6C 74 68 6F 75 67 68 20 69 74 27 73 20 61 20 00 
    2191.  00:4DD3                      TEXTO_CINEMATICA_1_3:
    2192.  00:4DD3                      		db		"prosperous village, the fear of the past",0
    2192.  00:4DD3  70 72 6F 73 70 65 72 6F 75 73 20 76 69 6C 6C 61 
    2192.  00:4DE3  67 65 2C 20 74 68 65 20 66 65 61 72 20 6F 66 20 
    2192.  00:4DF3  74 68 65 20 70 61 73 74 00 
    2193.  00:4DFC                      TEXTO_CINEMATICA_1_4:
    2194.  00:4DFC                      		db		"still lingers.",0
    2194.  00:4DFC  73 74 69 6C 6C 20 6C 69 6E 67 65 72 73 2E 00 
    2195.  00:4E0B                      
    2196.  00:4E0B                      TEXTO_CINEMATICA_2_1:
    2197.  00:4E0B                      		db		"And Deph Kurgan, hero of past ",0
    2197.  00:4E0B  41 6E 64 20 44 65 70 68 20 4B 75 72 67 61 6E 2C 
    2197.  00:4E1B  20 68 65 72 6F 20 6F 66 20 70 61 73 74 20 00 
    2198.  00:4E2A                      TEXTO_CINEMATICA_2_2:
    2199.  00:4E2A                      		db		"adventures, feels in his bones how",0
    2199.  00:4E2A  61 64 76 65 6E 74 75 72 65 73 2C 20 66 65 65 6C 
    2199.  00:4E3A  73 20 69 6E 20 68 69 73 20 62 6F 6E 65 73 20 68 
    2199.  00:4E4A  6F 77 00 
    2200.  00:4E4D                      TEXTO_CINEMATICA_2_3:
    2201.  00:4E4D                      		db		"evil is approaching once more.",0
    2201.  00:4E4D  65 76 69 6C 20 69 73 20 61 70 70 72 6F 61 63 68 
    2201.  00:4E5D  69 6E 67 20 6F 6E 63 65 20 6D 6F 72 65 2E 00 
    2202.  00:4E6C                      TEXTO_CINEMATICA_2_4:
    2203.  00:4E6C  20 20 20 00         		db		"   ",0
    2204.  00:4E70                      
    2205.  00:4E70                      TEXTO_CINEMATICA_3_1:
    2206.  00:4E70                      		db		"And one night, his worst nightmares come",0
    2206.  00:4E70  41 6E 64 20 6F 6E 65 20 6E 69 67 68 74 2C 20 68 
    2206.  00:4E80  69 73 20 77 6F 72 73 74 20 6E 69 67 68 74 6D 61 
    2206.  00:4E90  72 65 73 20 63 6F 6D 65 00 
    2207.  00:4E99                      TEXTO_CINEMATICA_3_2:
    2208.  00:4E99                      		db		"true. Lord Adder floods the sky,",0
    2208.  00:4E99  74 72 75 65 2E 20 4C 6F 72 64 20 41 64 64 65 72 
    2208.  00:4EA9  20 66 6C 6F 6F 64 73 20 74 68 65 20 73 6B 79 2C 
    2208.  00:4EB9  00 
    2209.  00:4EBA                      TEXTO_CINEMATICA_3_3:
    2210.  00:4EBA                      		db		"threatening the crops and the lives of",0
    2210.  00:4EBA  74 68 72 65 61 74 65 6E 69 6E 67 20 74 68 65 20 
    2210.  00:4ECA  63 72 6F 70 73 20 61 6E 64 20 74 68 65 20 6C 69 
    2210.  00:4EDA  76 65 73 20 6F 66 00 
    2211.  00:4EE1                      TEXTO_CINEMATICA_3_4:
    2212.  00:4EE1                      		db		"the villagers.",0
    2212.  00:4EE1  74 68 65 20 76 69 6C 6C 61 67 65 72 73 2E 00 
    2213.  00:4EF0                      
    2214.  00:4EF0                      TEXTO_CINEMATICA_4_1:
    2215.  00:4EF0                      		db		"But Deph isn't intimidated by this",0				  	
    2215.  00:4EF0  42 75 74 20 44 65 70 68 20 69 73 6E 27 74 20 69 
    2215.  00:4F00  6E 74 69 6D 69 64 61 74 65 64 20 62 79 20 74 68 
    2215.  00:4F10  69 73 00 
    2216.  00:4F13                      TEXTO_CINEMATICA_4_2:
    2217.  00:4F13                      		db		"apocalyptic vision. He knows what he has",0
    2217.  00:4F13  61 70 6F 63 61 6C 79 70 74 69 63 20 76 69 73 69 
    2217.  00:4F23  6F 6E 2E 20 48 65 20 6B 6E 6F 77 73 20 77 68 61 
    2217.  00:4F33  74 20 68 65 20 68 61 73 00 
    2218.  00:4F3C                      TEXTO_CINEMATICA_4_3:
    2219.  00:4F3C                      		db		"to do. He's done it before.",0
    2219.  00:4F3C  74 6F 20 64 6F 2E 20 48 65 27 73 20 64 6F 6E 65 
    2219.  00:4F4C  20 69 74 20 62 65 66 6F 72 65 2E 00 
    2220.  00:4F58                      TEXTO_CINEMATICA_4_4:
    2221.  00:4F58  20 20 20 00         		db		"   ",0
    2222.  00:4F5C                      
    2223.  00:4F5C                      TEXTO_CINEMATICA_5_1:
    2224.  00:4F5C                      		db		"Deph will obtain the Earth Goddess Stone",0
    2224.  00:4F5C  44 65 70 68 20 77 69 6C 6C 20 6F 62 74 61 69 6E 
    2224.  00:4F6C  20 74 68 65 20 45 61 72 74 68 20 47 6F 64 64 65 
    2224.  00:4F7C  73 73 20 53 74 6F 6E 65 00 
    2225.  00:4F85                      TEXTO_CINEMATICA_5_2:
    2226.  00:4F85                      		db		"to stop Lord Adder. But this time, he",0
    2226.  00:4F85  74 6F 20 73 74 6F 70 20 4C 6F 72 64 20 41 64 64 
    2226.  00:4F95  65 72 2E 20 42 75 74 20 74 68 69 73 20 74 69 6D 
    2226.  00:4FA5  65 2C 20 68 65 00 
    2227.  00:4FAB                      TEXTO_CINEMATICA_5_3:
    2228.  00:4FAB                      		db		"will also obtain the sacred Diamond that",0
    2228.  00:4FAB  77 69 6C 6C 20 61 6C 73 6F 20 6F 62 74 61 69 6E 
    2228.  00:4FBB  20 74 68 65 20 73 61 63 72 65 64 20 44 69 61 6D 
    2228.  00:4FCB  6F 6E 64 20 74 68 61 74 00 
    2229.  00:4FD4                      TEXTO_CINEMATICA_5_4:
    2230.  00:4FD4                      		db		"will break the cycle.",0
    2230.  00:4FD4  77 69 6C 6C 20 62 72 65 61 6B 20 74 68 65 20 63 
    2230.  00:4FE4  79 63 6C 65 2E 00 
